      472   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      473        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
      474        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 11
      475        B-Help AT ROW 1 COL 54.88
      476        B-del-dr AT ROW 3 COL 11
